Package: rpactdash
Title: RPACT Trial Design Workbench
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Abhishek", email = "stat.absk@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny dashboard for learning confirmatory adaptive clinical
    trial design with the 'rpact' package, built as a tutorial and hands-on
    practice environment for new and junior statisticians. Every user-facing
    rpact function is exposed through a catalog-driven interface that mirrors
    the package API, with reproducible R code shown for every result.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
